{
    "title": "DITUO PDF",
    "description": "A powerful PDF processing tool that integrates multiple functions, designed to meet the diverse needs of users for PDF files in daily work, study, and life. Whether you want to quickly convert images and text to PDF format, or need to extract images and text information from PDF, or need advanced operations such as merging, splitting, and adding watermarks, it can easily handle it, making PDF processing simple and efficient.\r\n\ufeff\r\nCore function highlights:\r\n\ufeff\r\nImage/TXT to PDF: Supports converting images or TXT documents to PDF files, making sharing and storage more convenient.\r\nPDF extraction function:\r\nExtract images: Easily extract images of all pages from PDF files.\r\nExtract text: Extract text content from PDF and save it as a TXT file for further editing or analysis.\r\nPDF merge and split:\r\nMerge PDF: Supports merging multiple PDF files into one file for orderly management.\r\nSplit PDF: Split large PDF files into multiple small files as needed for easy management by chapter.\r\nPDF security protection:\r\nAdd watermark: Supports adding text watermarks to PDF pages to effectively prevent documents from being illegally copied or distributed.",
